{"id": 107463224, "slug": "oh-hi-silicon-valley-bank", "title": "Oh hi Silicon Valley Bank \ud83d\udc4b ", "subtitle": "Looks like the unicorn economy is experiencing a run for liquidity.", "post_date": "2023-03-09T21:45:16.530Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 161, "reaction_count": 6, "comment_count": 1, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 6}, "body_html": "<p>We shorted Silicon Valley Bank at Black Snow.</p><p>Twice.  Once in 2016, and then again post COVID.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email\u2026\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p>Terrible trade.  Stopped out twice.</p><p>Always 5 years ahead\u2026</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Bnvl!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6111e911-7ac1-495a-8de4-27e9c56334f8_880x391.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Bnvl!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6111e911-7ac1-495a-8de4-27e9