t;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;The Downside of the Yale Endowment Model - part 1&quot;,&quot;truncated_body_text&quot;:&quot;As far as we can see, the downside of the Dale Swensen's Yale endowment portfolio model is it's overweight illiquid, long duration assets like PE/VC. What's the impact of 300bps of tightening on a portfolio with 30yr duration?&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2022-10-06T18:06:02.558Z&quot;,&quot;like_count&quot;:0,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;bylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:23243013,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;previous_name&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9b105c7a-be33-446c-8823-b297b83d0062_512x512.jpeg&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Founder rose.ai, fmr global macro investor at Bridgewater and Lehman&quot;,&quot;profile_set_up_at&quot;:&quot;2021-11-10T02:40:15.283Z&quot;,&quot;publicationUsers&quot;:[],&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null,&quot;inviteAccepted&quot;:true}],&quot;utm_campaign&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"EmbeddedPostToDOM\"><a class=\"embedded-post\" native=\"true\" href=\"https://campbellramble.substack.com/p/the-downside-of-the-yale-endowment?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web\"><div class=\"embedded-post-header\"><img class=\"embedded-post-publication-logo\" src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KTpD!,w_56,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"embedded-post-publication-name\">Campbell Ramble</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-title-wrapper\"><div class=\"embedded-post-title\">The Downside of the Yale Endowment Model - part 1</div></div><div class=\"embedded-post-body\">As far as we can see, the downside of the Dale Swensen's Yale endowment portfolio model is it's overweight illiquid, long duration assets like PE/VC. What's the impact of 300bps of tightening on a portfolio with 30yr duration\u2026</div><div class=\"embedded-post-cta-wrapper\"><span class=\"embedded-post-cta\">Read more</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-meta\">4 years ago \u00b7 Alexander Campbell</div></a></div><p>Remember, there are bonds in the stocks, and the Fed is tightening.</p><p>Be careful out there.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email\u2026\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div>", "canonical_url": "https://www.campbellramble.ai/p/oh-hi-silicon-valley-bank", "postTags": []}